{"title":"An infovore shares his chats","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/958495241/0/marginalrevolution~An-infovore-shares-his-chats.html","date":1782548538000,"content":"<p>In conjunction with OpenAI, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://chatgptpro.substack.com/p/tyler-cowen\" target=\"_blank\">a short piece by me</a> on how to use GPT Pro for travel and a few other matters.  Excerpt:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>6. Learn what to look for in an art museum</p>\r\n<p>I’m visiting the Detroit Institute of Arts. Which pictures in particular should I be looking for, and what is some useful context for viewing them?</p>\r\n<p>Why was this chat valuable? “After two visits in three days, I would second the advice I got from this chat.”</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://chatgpt.com/share/6a3c5618-3bfc-83ea-8b91-c551efd03587\" target=\"_blank\"> the link to the answer</a>.  And know when to ask it to read the local newspapers for you, to learn about a place.</p>\r\n<p>There are some good photos in the piece, including some hitherto unpublished photos of Spinoza.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/an-infovore-shares-his-chats.html\">An infovore shares his chats</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/958495241/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/958495241/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/958495241/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.co